Emerging Market Opportunities
Advanced packaging and increasingly complex semiconductor manufacturing processes create opportunities for temporary surface protection films with consistent performance. Demand may also expand for specialty roll-converted products designed for specific wafer handling and cleanroom requirements.

Suppliers can differentiate through improved lot traceability, humidity-dependent performance control, clean-peel characteristics and adhesive formulations that minimize residue. Product development across PET, polyethylene and polyimide substrates may further broaden application opportunities.

